{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_title", "source_sha256": "64a8d829cd1c7847f16b32a9c59ec2392ed467993909e1e3a20161b4d70f028d", "ja": "アイ・無限大∞ポテンシャル", "zh": "爱・无限大∞潜力", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cba22b1044633ab8a4c8a2641215b58b5bdbed06585f5e71e704db2f1fe80042", "ja": "学園祭の実行委員長と新曲お披露目公演が\n重なった茜。周囲の心配をよそに準備にレッ\nスンにと張り切る。そんな中、副委員長に\n「どうしてそんなに頑張れるの？」と尋ね\nられた茜は、彼女をライブに招待する。", "zh": "学园祭的执行委员长与新曲公开演出撞\n到了一起。茜不顾周围人的担忧，干劲\n十足地投入到筹备与练习中。在此期间，\n副委员长问茜“为什么能这么拼命呢？”，\n茜便邀请她来看自己的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3c7ca55f0caf481446b565714def1e0b9485fe7ac02f9d4981e639bb7bf80688", "ja": "（定期公演のレッスンが始まった。今日は打ち合わせで\n立ち会えないけど、皆、しっかり頑張ってくれよ！）", "zh": "（定期公演的排练开始了。今天因为要开会没法到场，不过大家要好好加油啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "3a0159e97084490e98b584dc01caab6578904f37bcbf04ef8a17f40319d2fae1", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー……ターン、っと！\nよしっ、バッチリ揃ったね！", "zh": "一、二、三、四……转身，嘿！\n好，配合得非常完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9164eba0430bcfb28620eb09168c195acdcde5d5ce51fd87503f7d3624f25b0c", "ja": "うん、初日にしてはいい感じじゃない？\n公演まで、まだ時間あるしね。", "zh": "嗯，作为第一天来说，感觉不是挺不错的吗？\n离演出还有时间呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "9f63129d3d2bea9f1053c3b372859426f93578b6bbaad4a7f3810ab555c655ed", "ja": "いやー、よかったよかった！　茜ちゃん、何しろ\n忙しいからね。昨日とか8時間しか寝てないし！", "zh": "哎呀～太好了太好了！小茜不管怎么说都很忙嘛。像昨天我也就睡了8个小时而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "14f3b565c061f6bf9189555d04afd0931fa6ef7cc6bc6c99d1efb6192f544214", "ja": "それ、けっこう寝てるよね？\n茜が忙しいのは、もうわかったってば～。", "zh": "其实你睡得已经挺多了吧？\n茜很忙这件事，我已经知道啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "c60f9fbdfe620940b59ef700200d08917dea5ae5468336d77a559ba554bd8133", "ja": "茜ちん、大変そうだねー。なら今日のレッスンは\nもう終わりにして、おやつタイムにしない？", "zh": "茜茜好像很忙呢——。那今天的课程就到此为止，改成点心时间怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "a587740c62a0913a40e30dc6067784c19b3174b5f276350df062c9b33939eb76", "ja": "ナイスアイディアだよ、亜美ちゃん！\n忙しい茜ちゃんには、休息が必要なのだ～！", "zh": "真是个好主意，亚美！忙碌的小茜需要休息才行～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e52171e60ae91f3fefbc9b67faa4aec9efb528436028a67cd348601cb38ea4e2", "ja": "亜美さん、野々原さん。それはいけません。\nまだ、レッスンの時間内です。", "zh": "亚美小姐、野野原小姐。这样不行。现在还在上课时间内。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aeda2cd4a720e34d3430a614dfda1eccd88afb79a11ecaf317af7ab0c294f930", "ja": "{$P$}から、くれぐれもふたりを\n頼むと言われています。さあ、練習に戻ってください。", "zh": "{$P$}特意嘱咐过我，一定要照看好你们两位。好了，请回去练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "0acf1892ec4eb1d64aff5a82c7fdd0e2399fb72d9a3a85b3783454a666dc3ece", "ja": "アタシも、紬に賛成かな～。\n今のとこ、もうちょっとやっときたいしね。", "zh": "我也赞成紬的意见吧～。\n我还想再多练一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0cb02a743e8c99911e5458c18ca8df5287eab0eb99e4ee6e670c1ea5439541b5", "ja": "ほらほら、ふたりとも！\nもうちょっとだし、がんばろうよ。", "zh": "好啦好啦，你们两个！再坚持一下，加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "61227cff422e5c253ef11c13c7fc4d67a08bc74d890ca79390df90f713097a1c", "ja": "うあうあー！　兄ちゃんが策士だよー！\nシンガーソングライターだよー！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊——！哥哥真是个策士啊——！\n是创作歌手啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "2c7ffb0595dcbf747f78683c1fdf782a7d1a97075ebfa5cc88d635ecc459ef3f", "ja": "律子さんがいないから、ノビノビできると思ったのに！\nおのれ、{$P$}ちゃんめー！", "zh": "明明律子小姐不在，还以为能自由自在地放松一下呢！\n可恶的{$P$}，气死我啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b1a1705fa2e15de5bf4c34014074d02e9b7a6b64be1f63850c9c0d86de634185", "ja": "（すっかり遅くなってしまったな。\nみんな、レッスンちゃんとできたかな……）", "zh": "（已经这么晚了。大家有好好完成训练吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "f59cb4fd0e288913146cf27ec62489e7fbc0a92d9a902300ceabfd87911f575d", "ja": "う、ウニャ……。", "zh": "呜、呜喵……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1016_p", "source_sha256": "43cc07bc7ff55aeb9818ee4cb38793896195d2414bb67bbe46542a8e442636bb", "ja": "えっ？　……茜？\nどうしたんだ、こんなところで……。", "zh": "诶？……茜？\n你怎么会在这种地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "8daef4a783d5822ea7ba19dc98e122c4dd45789fd5b188973a2b7173692baeef", "ja": "あ、{$P$}ちゃん……おかえり～。\nどうもこうも、つむりんがスパルタで……ウニャ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……欢迎回来～。\n还能怎么样嘛，紬琳她实在太斯巴达了……呜喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0207f6e9935e531832e0b7b036895301dba1db60ec348153bc401beeb7df2bb1", "ja": "そうか……練習頑張ったんだな。\nお疲れさま。", "zh": "这样啊……看来你努力练习了。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1019_p", "source_sha256": "849c3a6eaf9670e729d991bdf6709898da8d2dbc01dfca4d6896d6759ea5487f", "ja": "……なあ、茜。やっぱり新曲お披露目、延期するか？\n学園祭の方も、忙しいんだろ？", "zh": "……茜。新曲的首次公开，还是延期吧？\n学园祭那边，你也挺忙的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "371d943b1bc959e3593ddccffffd0c84ceea2721ee715f3805403af56ead530e", "ja": "ニャッ！？　ダメダメ！\n茜ちゃん、やるったらやるんだから。", "zh": "喵！？不行不行！小茜，说要做就一定要做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "556bb62279c03f41a7a5a8d700cd73b722f00f1c1867161f8480965e27ff8154", "ja": "それに、これくらいのスケジュールもこなせない\nようじゃ、トップアイドルになんてなれないもんね！", "zh": "而且，连这种程度的日程都应付不来，可是当不了顶级偶像的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a5313e66a3a638ce09455f6da0d6e2f47f8e3f07c9094e1aca2b5624d138e645", "ja": "うーん、そうか……。", "zh": "嗯——这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "6643f0a1d1e89b5015c51c607febc204e863c19764ddb59b212716de87c5b1b2", "ja": "そうそう、そうなの！　それに、なーんか\nちょっと気になることもあるんだよね……。", "zh": "对对，就是这样！而且呢，总觉得还有件事有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1024_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "e8ae65550e69d563bc9fb102e1ea37815be80ba53e4f85928a61cb322834f867", "ja": "あ、こっちの話！　それより茜ちゃん、\n{$P$}ちゃんに質問があります！", "zh": "啊，我说的是这个！先不说这个，小茜，\n我有问题想问{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "d122a0d0cda02ec72016336c2a4945614e1b6a5b9e3a5d76d79aee90dbfd720c", "ja": "茜ちゃん、学園祭のステージに出てもいい？\nサプライズで、ライブをやりたいんだよね。", "zh": "小茜，我可以参加学园祭的舞台吗？\n我想给大家一个惊喜，办一场演唱会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1027_p", "source_sha256": "fc585a11542fa324f2d1ef521c59cea43787666972cd31692821ac9a744f987a", "ja": "うん？　ああ、それは構わないけど……。\nわざわざ断りを入れるなんて、えらいな。", "zh": "嗯？啊，这倒是没问题，不过……\n你还特意来打招呼，真懂事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "4b739295adbfd26702ae37e84824dd7d89e1a193dabc59f5cea1c9367232e241", "ja": "だってホラ、茜ちゃんはプロのアイドルだからね！\n本当だったら、ギャラが発生しちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "因为你看，小茜可是专业偶像嘛！按理说，是要付报酬的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0e73981812657673e3d63f1ab043f423c91e0a8c0145bfa7c24c8d8283fb4587", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\nなんなら茜が払ってくれてもいいんだけど。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。\n要不让茜来付也行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "c992aba67a79d2c708ffc1db00bd74d1890061914f69d233b764a314efd4a8b4", "ja": "茜ちゃんが出るのに、茜ちゃんが払うの！？\nそれって搾取だよ！　アイドル業界の闇だよー！", "zh": "小茜要上场，结果却让小茜付钱！？这不是剥削吗！这是偶像业界的黑暗啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1031_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4b9895fd3ca7483ceec14f4e359d5aca51b74fd4c7db877936a1efd4131d09b", "ja": "フゥー……今日の分、どうにか終わったね～。\n副委員長ちゃん、ありがと～。お疲れちゃん！", "zh": "呼——……今天的份总算想办法完成了呢～。\n副委员长，谢啦～辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1033_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "12ab20adca52f41be0d1f7601d10ac0e8b0209c45b7d81e41624873eda460bb0", "ja": "ううん。野々原さんこそ、お疲れさま。", "zh": "没事。野々原你也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "26b76b0302fefab34bc8c073deddeec26be0ba283f50bab7641c2173a7b379ac", "ja": "わっ、もうこんな時間！？　茜ちゃん、レッスンに\n行かなくちゃ。じゃあ、また明日ね！", "zh": "哇，都这个时间了！？小茜，得去上课\n了。那就明天见啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1035_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "57e00514eb065b46b8deb41f57c648f9c27f2b359b56354259150744214d012d", "ja": "あ……ま、待って、野々原さんっ！", "zh": "啊……等、等一下，野野原小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1037_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "aad108abacfc12ce98ff1a27f6727115f356ff0df7bf4dfb73421f28dd119eee", "ja": "あの……わ、私、\n野々原さんに、聞きたいことがあって……。", "zh": "那个……我、我有件事，\n想问问野野原小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1038_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "0ab5879c41369f690a92e0d3f469dde2c344df089056e57d8cfa77ee6c2dc3f4", "ja": "……野々原さんは、どうしてそんなに頑張れるの？\n忙しくても、ずっと楽しそうだし……。", "zh": "……野野原，你为什么能这么努力呢？\n就算再忙，也一直显得那么开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1039_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "ede672c3cd02163c1da9f213a7449fc57b6cd6fe748201bc0db1ad816646044e", "ja": "頑張るのが……イヤになったり、しないの……？", "zh": "你……不会觉得努力很讨厌了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "514040787fdc37680d3b4fb33b3b9b8d6d12e16a96d79a069d50d6621fbf418f", "ja": "どうしてがんばれる……？\nんー。んー……？", "zh": "为什么能一直努力……？\n嗯——嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "807153eb7dd755e1ffc9d52996483b6e73cc9f25b65b1729eadec0066022a19a", "ja": "言われてみれば、どうしてなんだろ？\n茜ちゃんにも、よくわかんないかも……？", "zh": "被你这么一问，我自己也不知道是为什么呢？\n就连小茜自己，好像也搞不太清楚……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1042_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "7ff25585f96fa2a1c7cf34345a09741e15289a2752c0a55f1197518b113c269c", "ja": "えっ……ええ～っ！？", "zh": "咦……诶——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1043_023aka", "source_sha256": "c0bb2474e23e9340df274b1e35630bd42a0d52ddea8270f23648f88dde07624d", "ja": "あっ、いや待って！　……そうだ！\n副委員長ちゃん、今度、劇場に茜ちゃんを見にきてよ！", "zh": "啊，不对，等等！……对了！副委员长，下次来剧场看看小茜吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "f3a15f57f8f94928f3aa2b7beb0dfa79835d83dbe5ea40e4115946b5fefa30de", "ja": "次の公演で、茜ちゃんの新曲お披露目があるんだけど。\n見てくれたら、何かわかるかも！", "zh": "下次公演会有小茜的新歌首次亮相。你要是来看，说不定就能明白些什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1045_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "16d9d769914bb6e842f3ede715ef37c15b940056e0e61bd623ec425af3d5c9f3", "ja": "えっ？　ええと……。", "zh": "咦？呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1046_023aka", "source_sha256": "e303c58df8c9d63e477b39cbbd64d88a72591c195b7014c2efa390841f52dd60", "ja": "あっ、チケットのことは心配しないで♪　茜ちゃんが\n招待するから！　それじゃ、バイバーイ！", "zh": "啊，门票的事不用担心♪　小茜会\n请客的！那就这样，拜拜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1047_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1048_023aka", "source_sha256": "a8fcbfffa3aa0c580aea5150c87c906f597ba2e855a61f1a3bd90a7d98ad975f", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……お待たせ！\nふたりともゴメンね、残ってもらっちゃって……！", "zh": "呼、呼……让你们久等了！\n真对不起，还让你们两个留下来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1049_020meg", "source_sha256": "4a534d8257c5d1801f8f63501de120a2c1c9f4f1e9a70764ea2dc7921fc3a644", "ja": "お疲れ、茜～。そんなこと気にしなくて大丈夫だって。\nあと、明日は紬と亜美も残れるってさ！", "zh": "辛苦啦，茜～。都说了，不用在意这种事，没关系的啦。\n还有，听说纺和亚美明天也能留下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1050_034ayu", "source_sha256": "834790d9a3c0a871177857a0daee0879440f9f5eee9457a8a1eb285344a5fd68", "ja": "茜、レッスンもいいけど、ちょっと休んだら？\nアタシたちなら、時間は大丈夫だからさ。", "zh": "茜，练习固然好，但要不要稍微休息一下？\n我们时间上没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1051_023aka", "source_sha256": "efae16be9cdad360c176feea98f85c33a0dc7e82ead822baf3d8926fae7583b9", "ja": "ありがと、マイハマン！　でも大丈夫♪\n何故なら、茜ちゃんは元気いっぱいなのだ～！", "zh": "谢谢你，舞滨侠！不过没问题♪\n因为小茜可是元气满满的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1052_020meg", "source_sha256": "d116a98621f06efe4b9ef03f1d9883c4d10b9de85868e99adb1c0fdeb8cd7bdf", "ja": "とか言って～。今日も忙しかったんじゃないの？\nあんまり無理すると、本番までもたないよ～。", "zh": "嘴上这么说～。你今天不是也很忙吗？\n太勉强自己的话，可撑不到正式演出那天哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1053_023aka", "source_sha256": "0ee8f6dac894e8b685a9b876bc09fd32adf147d098b2e751437eaac3fd28a6c3", "ja": "正直、疲れてはいる！　いるけど、無理はしてない！\n茜ちゃん、今、やる気がみなぎっているからね！", "zh": "说实话，我确实累了！虽然累，但没有硬撑！\n小茜，我现在可是干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1054_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b90d828a86c41edc01941b92544febf496eb8bb1b775e3e147451f84537bc333", "ja": "おーっ、茜、気合いすごいじゃん！\nでも、なんで？", "zh": "哦——茜，你干劲十足嘛！  \n不过，为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1055_023aka", "source_sha256": "009293af841a048f420be3b403fa9d04c341a82c86d75bb446c8610de1603dd7", "ja": "なんで……ナンデ？　今日はいっぱい、\nどうしてとかなんでって聞かれる日だなー。", "zh": "为什么……为什——么？今天真是会被问好多“为什么”“怎么会”的一天啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1056_023aka", "source_sha256": "322972ba3ec51755fadbe29ffb70047cf7f9327e31df60400b2c730e42059481", "ja": "いやね、みんなの期待を背負っている！と思うと、こう\n……すっごくやる気になるんだよね！　茜ちゃんは！", "zh": "不是啦，一想到自己背负着大家的期待！就会……特别有干劲呢！小茜可是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1057_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7ac8f15fd1a9f9e98a86be9a618ea52f1cd2a8060b2a664f2294bf809a657818", "ja": "なるほど、そうでしたか。では野々原さんは、普段の\nレッスンも、その気構えでやれば良いのでは……？", "zh": "原来如此。这样的话，野野原小姐平时上课时，也保持这样的觉悟不就好了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1058_011ami", "source_sha256": "b2eb108d6323f8ebfa1d7263ec8d5636bbcfe53b4c5e06fb7ea53fb4a51e63d6", "ja": "亜美は、茜ちんの気持ちわかるな～。レッスンが\nイヤなんじゃないんだよ。ただサボりたいんだよ～。", "zh": "亜美懂茜的心情啦～。不是讨厌练习，只是想偷懒不去啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1059_023aka", "source_sha256": "ac352cb4a81f15e8f7b380fb898e7cedfb16e18574acb7576f85cc87756d32a6", "ja": "さすが亜美ちゃん、話がわかるね！　……って、\nあれっ！？　ふたりとも帰ったんじゃなかったの？", "zh": "不愧是亚美，真懂我！……等等！？你们两个不是已经回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1060_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e2208fb4fb414dfd4082d7f0e48e90cd2973421c364333fd8f933a826c108d7d", "ja": "どうしても、気になってしまったので……。\n用事を済ませて、戻って参りました。", "zh": "因为实在有些在意……\n办完事情后，我们就回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1061_011ami", "source_sha256": "7a22a15e41a3f5177f7d728a315e88635188a49a083bd2017d03ee5ff48b55f4", "ja": "亜美も、ママにちゃんと言ってきたよーん。\nんじゃ、サクッとレッスンしちゃおー！", "zh": "亚美也好好跟妈妈说过了哦——\n那就赶紧开始训练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1062_023aka", "source_sha256": "e302d53ce816a0929dcb2b0ae956298d95c50e18b078ea6766ab0aebdf6c1bd8", "ja": "みんな、茜ちゃんのために……！\nありがとう！　茜ちゃんは幸せ者です！", "zh": "大家，为了小茜……！\n谢谢大家！小茜真是个幸福的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1063_023aka", "source_sha256": "3e8117ba9ef2756060ca4e41830a8a98a037c3af28b53a7ac94647ec8b62210c", "ja": "よーし、それじゃレッスン開始！\n頭から通しでいいよね？　いくよーっ！", "zh": "好，那就开始训练！\n从头到尾完整来一遍，没问题吧？要开始咯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1065_p", "source_sha256": "54224fb23c98fa37b9acf446e7ceb8257e0a6558fadeaa930d55785da2eda65a", "ja": "……で、頑張りすぎて、こんな時間になっちゃったと。\n熱心なのはありがたいけど。", "zh": "……所以说，一不小心练过头，就到这个时间了啊。\n虽然用心是很值得高兴啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1066_020meg", "source_sha256": "e9b80317dea0de82d53d85e801cc03d53df247683ababf778ebdbbb9add77d7a", "ja": "にゃはは♪　ゴメンゴメン！\nつい、気合い入っちゃってさ～。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪抱歉抱歉！\n不知不觉就干劲十足起来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1067_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d7fc02321c0020a43e3f3dffb2c1a137ebc480716bb3aeedff9e25eb1109abce", "ja": "すみません……。{$P$}にレッスンの\n進行を任されたというのに、このような時間まで……。", "zh": "对不起……明明受{$P$}委托负责推进训练，却拖到这么晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1068_p", "source_sha256": "51fc47d5e22ca6be84f293e8eb1df9cf8a82bbc242cca4eba97001d8bb8436e2", "ja": "いやいや紬が謝る事じゃないよ。ひとまずお疲れさま！\nみんなの家に連絡を入れておかないとな。", "zh": "不是不是，这不是紬需要道歉的事。总之，辛苦了！得先联系一下大家的家里才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1069_023aka", "source_sha256": "7fabce65b1de1fcc8cdfd8198d7528daba1e0a156439af50facee0b0014ac7ca", "ja": "むにゃ……うぅん、{$P$}ちゃん\nダメだよ、茜ちゃん人形をそんな乱暴に……ぐう……。", "zh": "唔……嗯，{$P$}，不可以把小茜人偶弄得那么粗暴……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1070_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb1c2a7e98e3bf2557a8f7f32cb0769d742f6a5af112a1355f87dd186e16f8d6", "ja": "おーい、茜～？　おーいってば～。\n……ダメだ、起きないや。よっぽど疲れてたんだな～。", "zh": "喂——茜～？喂——我说你呢～。\n……不行，完全叫不醒。看来真是累坏了啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1071_011ami", "source_sha256": "3f62926d796c0be51bb8b835cb069b67a9307226a9580071a6bbd4b530f6bdb4", "ja": "茜ちん、完全におネムだね～。\n……そうだ！　兄ちゃん、サインペンあったよね？", "zh": "茜茜完全睡着啦～。\n……对了！哥哥，你那里有签字笔吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1072_p", "source_sha256": "70fc084d7f9feb631167fd516a0733f14313d3dfcecf15bd8b201a8ee1320e23", "ja": "寝ている人の顔に落書きしようとするんじゃない。\n茜は……そうだな、もう少し寝かせてあげようか。", "zh": "不许往睡着的人脸上乱涂乱画。\n茜的话……也是，让她再多睡一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1073_020meg", "source_sha256": "b76c7ea18e80e526b2c5e54f3b8393497e58e98707fb52954f0e2ff6fe383753", "ja": "オッケー！　倉庫に、毛布あったよね？\nアタシ、取ってくる。", "zh": "好！仓库里应该有毛毯吧？\n我去拿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1074_p", "source_sha256": "d0e710e001fdcb0aa2eff9ac64c04c5448bfaf304755f8d01804bab5283e6f01", "ja": "他のみんなは、車で送ろう。\nとりあえず、着替えてからエントランスに集合な！", "zh": "其他人就开车送回去吧。\n总之，先换好衣服，然后到入口集合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1076_p", "source_sha256": "c81ca7bd651a1e3a5e83adbe2a86ab989d3858d97818ff49891832c3365a88c0", "ja": "茜？　おーい、そろそろ起きてくれ。", "zh": "茜？喂——差不多该起床了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1077_023aka", "source_sha256": "74a399fa03a51fc57f153569578844dfc146e2d0ae6427afcb77139a7dbcfa1f", "ja": "ん……。ふわぁぁ…………はっ！？", "zh": "嗯……哈啊啊…………哈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1078_023aka", "source_sha256": "b55b509bbdce183ecfc3f6b581c2ece1ee61da41b307d3dbdf763c970e4a0410", "ja": "ウニャーッ！　茜ちゃんってば、寝てた！？\nご、ごめんごめん、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "喵——！小茜居然睡着了！？  \n对、对不起对不起，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1079_023aka", "source_sha256": "b80f194954690651756c1ba1a44cc3c10f72df883b92df590d118fc0bd55740a", "ja": "あっ、でもカワイイカワイイ茜ちゃんの寝顔を\n見られたから、むしろ役得だった？　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "啊，不过能看到可可爱爱的小茜睡脸，反而是我赚到了？喵哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1080_p", "source_sha256": "614e7755fc39fb692e35d91ba16b3d6bd5d6e2982788496c21c0421b48a3c2b8", "ja": "ニャハッ、じゃなくて。……茜、本当に大丈夫なのか？\nそんなに無理してるんだったら、今からでも……。", "zh": "别喵哈了。……茜，你真的没事吗？要是你这么勉强自己的话，现在开始也还……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1081_023aka", "source_sha256": "c88a00155d54ea174333291c54896abc3c82e93a405f22fe6eb6abe2285b26c5", "ja": "も、も～っ！　{$P$}ちゃんってば、\n心配性なんだから。茜ちゃんなら、本当に大丈夫！", "zh": "真是的～！{$P$}也太爱操心了。小茜的话，真的没问题啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1082_023aka", "source_sha256": "7f515474075c6fbdda15131ce22efa34e40c3d0925cd062810d5f4bf006cc545", "ja": "そりゃー、全然しんどくないって言ったら\nウソになるけど……でもなんか、楽しいんだよね！", "zh": "要说一点都不累，那肯定是骗人的……不过，总觉得还挺开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1083_p", "source_sha256": "f98e028c78d0e6559e525ddfac44cc5dd888d2f56fe9cd7e90e5c0664e5046b2", "ja": "楽しい？", "zh": "开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1084_023aka", "source_sha256": "12d648d4960e60997d27dfd50ef82d23b66db8f65d22cd8873fad2b76ff8e18d", "ja": "うん！　今！　この瞬間！　最高に輝いてる\n茜ちゃんを見て！　……って感じ？", "zh": "嗯！现在！就在这一瞬间！正闪耀到最耀眼呢！\n看着闪耀到极致的小茜！……大概就是这种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1085_023aka", "source_sha256": "49409a84e239cd87c8e1acca67721963f9ec25417c9b2c0f3afb5e4b06865883", "ja": "心配しなくても、本当の本当に辛い時は、\nちゃんと{$P$}ちゃんに頼るよ！", "zh": "不用担心啦，要是真的真的很难熬的时候，\n茜肯定会好好依靠{$P$}的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1086_023aka", "source_sha256": "c791302b3ab3bb6d683080173ca2ca8c2b7704f5c72934eb969de5e3d0d34a07", "ja": "だって{$P$}ちゃんは、\n茜ちゃんのプロデューサーだからね！", "zh": "因为{$P$}可是小茜的制作人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1087_p", "source_sha256": "bb948eb4fd6fb2daeda4b503a44f66cdeb7f51a8219704a1e6a6722ef3ad0ca3", "ja": "茜……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1088_p", "source_sha256": "911bba5cfbe84ff65253f2da774d8c1b169b8febd7d92b356bec4cdd8ac6f36c", "ja": "（様々なステージを経て、茜にも、アイドルとしての\n自覚のようなものが芽生えたのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（经历了各种各样的舞台后，茜或许也开始萌生了身为偶像的自觉……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1089_p", "source_sha256": "f06068da0c5a3022a307df66ecca184e698ee02ba41e35aea3a9cefb20f1c898", "ja": "（元々、茜のアイドルとしてのポテンシャルは高い。\nこれなら、トップアイドルも本当に夢じゃ……！）", "zh": "茜原本作为偶像的潜力就很高。这样一来，成为顶尖偶像也真的不再是梦想了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1090_023aka", "source_sha256": "be94174e00b210b74e327164d9629609778dcf4a4618b38ccaedac72b5dfc8cb", "ja": "というわけで……{$P$}ちゃん！\n今日のところは、茜ちゃんを家まで送り届けるのだ～！", "zh": "所以说……{$P$}小朋友！  \n今天就由我把小茜送回家吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1091_023aka", "source_sha256": "0e8030b18d474ef0d7b1cc3bd955e539b8fe23cd0d46546b0fc1f5e19fc6e498", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　あと、茜ちゃんの公演のチケット、\n1枚もらってもいい？　学校の友達を招待したいんだ☆", "zh": "啊，对了！另外，能给我小茜公演的门票1张吗？我想邀请学校里的朋友来看☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1092_p", "source_sha256": "d54fed77ae71f4953add615e41585f98462571c1f55df07ce017eaffb1d359e1", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。それくらいお安い御用だ！", "zh": "啊，当然。那点小事不在话下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_086_1093_p", "source_sha256": "ce35f116d8be0011606e41a016f6bf92a6985b7d329474978f2a3456176750a8", "ja": "（アイドルとして、一段成長した茜の新曲お披露目……\nどんなステージになるのか、楽しみになってきたぞ！）", "zh": "（作为偶像成长了一大步的茜，要首次公开演唱新歌了……\n真是越来越期待她会带来怎样的舞台了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
